&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;SP-01：グラニセトロン経皮吸収型製剤（Sancuso&lt;span style="font-size: 14px"&gt;&lt;sup&gt;®&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;）&lt;/p&gt;
